    "Meditations and audio will stream when you're online. You can download everything again at any time." : {

    },
    "Meditations come from our server. If you're offline, or they haven't been added yet, some meditations may not be available. Check your internet connection and try again." : {
      "comment" : "Help & Support: the answer to the question above it; names of buttons and settings must match the app's own words"
    },
    "Meditations, narration, the Hours of Prayer (the Divine Office), the words of the prayers, and the chants' recordings and sheet music come from our own server; the Mass texts from Missale Meum; the books and recordings under Spiritual Reading from Project Gutenberg and LibriVox. Each receives the request itself, as any website does, and nothing more. The app carries no analytics or advertising code from anyone else, and nothing is used to track you." : {
      "comment" : "Privacy Policy: a section's text; keep it as plain and exact as the English"
    },
