    "The Rosary begins with the Sign of the Cross and the Creed and ends with the Hail, Holy Queen, each with its words." : {
      "comment" : "Settings, Opening and Closing Prayers: the line under the chosen option"
    },
    "The Rosary is always the same prayer: the same mysteries in the same order, with ten Hail Marys for each. A meditation set gives you words to think about while you pray.\n\nEach set has one meditation for each mystery: five for the Rosary, or seven for the Seven Sorrows." : {

